WEBVTT

01:31.640 --> 01:32.700
=The Road to Splendor=

01:32.700 --> 01:34.760
(Adapted from China Literature author
Zhizhi's novel of the same name)

01:35.140 --> 01:37.553
=Episode 10=

01:38.567 --> 01:40.287
Now that the Yan family has fallen,

01:40.448 --> 01:42.287
Madam Yu has been bedridden ever since.

01:42.968 --> 01:45.368
Could it be that she not only
failed to earn merit,

01:45.728 --> 01:47.127
but is also being blamed?

01:48.368 --> 01:50.088
A smart woman like Madam Yu

01:50.088 --> 01:50.968
surely would not.

01:51.127 --> 01:52.368
You're overthinking it.

01:52.368 --> 01:53.767
I heard something, though.

01:53.847 --> 01:55.207
Her daughter-in-law

01:55.448 --> 01:56.808
stirred up a huge mess.

01:57.008 --> 01:57.888
Really?

01:57.888 --> 01:58.927
I heard that too.

01:59.248 --> 02:00.207
See?

02:00.327 --> 02:01.968
Trying to win favor
with the imperial court

02:01.968 --> 02:03.047
is no easy thing.

02:03.248 --> 02:05.448
One misstep and the whole game is lost.

02:05.927 --> 02:08.048
I doubt the Yu family will recover

02:08.048 --> 02:09.208
anytime soon.

02:09.648 --> 02:11.287
Alright. Let's just play.

02:22.870 --> 02:24.236
(20,000 taels; 5,000 taels.
20 shops: 30,000 taels.)

02:24.250 --> 02:25.000
(Cash: 42,000 taels.
Grand total: 97,000 taels.)

02:27.607 --> 02:28.887
The accounts don't match.

02:32.289 --> 02:33.122
(Annual Accounts of the Xie Family)

02:36.528 --> 02:37.167
Zhao Ling.

02:39.528 --> 02:40.287
Come in.

02:45.887 --> 02:46.928
Didn't I tell you

02:47.248 --> 02:49.447
to hand over all of Jiuweijiao's assets?

02:50.607 --> 02:52.048
Why is three thousand taels missing?

03:00.248 --> 03:01.648
If you want to clear the accounts,

03:02.088 --> 03:03.488
you must hand over everything.

03:03.648 --> 03:05.048
Why be greedy for such a small gain?

03:05.447 --> 03:06.968
You gave up a hundred thousand taels.

03:06.968 --> 03:07.928
What's three thousand?

03:14.488 --> 03:16.048
Aren't you going back to the capital,
Miss Xie?

03:18.968 --> 03:20.208
Why do you still bother with this?

03:22.847 --> 03:24.208
From now on,

03:26.368 --> 03:27.768
just take good care of yourself.

03:30.968 --> 03:31.808
My affairs

03:33.328 --> 03:34.248
are none of your concern.

03:36.328 --> 03:37.768
None of my concern?

03:43.968 --> 03:45.127
These three thousand taels

03:45.488 --> 03:47.048
are enough to get you executed.

03:54.127 --> 03:54.687
All right.

03:56.847 --> 03:58.687
I only did this for your own good.

04:00.528 --> 04:01.928
Yet you think I meddle too much.

04:03.127 --> 04:03.447
I

04:03.447 --> 04:04.287
must have

04:04.687 --> 04:06.287
overestimated my importance.

04:09.887 --> 04:11.167
Let's hope you can keep it hidden.

04:11.808 --> 04:13.208
If you leave loose ends now

04:13.567 --> 04:14.808
and trouble arises later,

04:14.928 --> 04:16.448
this will all be evidence
for confiscating your property.

04:28.568 --> 04:29.328
Miss Xie.

04:30.128 --> 04:31.888
Are we really going back to the capital?

04:32.047 --> 04:33.407
Can you bear to leave Mr. Zhao?

04:36.827 --> 04:38.588
(Xie Residence)

04:38.727 --> 04:39.688
Miss Xie.

04:40.008 --> 04:42.088
For your help in the case, His Highness

04:42.208 --> 04:44.208
has sent me to invite you
to claim your reward.

04:45.847 --> 04:47.088
I am grateful for His Highness's favor.

04:49.407 --> 04:50.607
Actually,

04:51.047 --> 04:52.407
there's one more favor to ask.

04:53.247 --> 04:55.287
His Highness truly values Zhao Ling.

04:55.528 --> 04:57.328
He wants you to advise him.

05:00.328 --> 05:02.528
Joining the army is just an excuse.

05:02.688 --> 05:03.768
The main purpose

05:03.888 --> 05:05.607
is to change his identity.

05:06.328 --> 05:08.088
After a few years of training,

05:08.088 --> 05:09.528
he'll be moved to the capital.

05:09.927 --> 05:11.528
With His Highness's favor,

05:12.047 --> 05:13.968
he will have a bright future.

05:14.807 --> 05:16.648
He was chosen
by the Sixteenth Master himself.

05:17.047 --> 05:17.888
What do you call that?

05:18.528 --> 05:19.688
That's called a trusted aide.

05:27.128 --> 05:28.008
I understand.

05:31.688 --> 05:32.247
Alright.

05:32.528 --> 05:33.648
I'll take my leave.

05:59.850 --> 06:00.463
(A thousand taels)

06:00.487 --> 06:01.927
(You gave up a hundred thousand taels.)

06:02.088 --> 06:03.648
(What's three thousand?)

06:04.448 --> 06:05.807
(The world is wide.)

06:06.847 --> 06:07.768
(I wish you well.)

06:27.927 --> 06:28.768
You haven't left?

06:36.008 --> 06:36.888
I thought...

06:36.888 --> 06:37.768
Thought what?

06:38.088 --> 06:38.968
You thought

06:39.807 --> 06:41.008
I'd be back in the capital.

06:41.208 --> 06:43.008
Wasn't the Sixteenth Master
going to reward you?

06:45.807 --> 06:47.407
Miss Xie, you did well in the salt case.

06:47.888 --> 06:49.128
Is there anything you desire?

06:53.768 --> 06:55.807
I wish to have a proper identity.

06:56.167 --> 06:58.328
A household register
under the name of Xie Tingyun.

06:59.088 --> 07:00.367
My family fell from grace.

07:00.367 --> 07:01.407
I barely escaped with my life.

07:01.607 --> 07:02.568
My household was struck off the rolls.

07:03.287 --> 07:05.247
To walk in this world,

07:05.328 --> 07:06.528
I need that document.

07:09.287 --> 07:10.008
True.

07:10.528 --> 07:11.888
You and Zhao Ling share deep feelings.

07:12.208 --> 07:13.328
You'll need that document

07:13.607 --> 07:15.328
to marry with proper ceremony.

07:16.453 --> 07:17.613
(Household Register)

07:17.648 --> 07:19.167
This is the reward I want.

07:27.568 --> 07:29.088
Mr. Zhao, will you marry me?

07:34.807 --> 07:36.448
Though I was born into a noble family,

07:36.968 --> 07:39.287
I now have nothing.

07:39.568 --> 07:41.008
Thank you for your kindness,

07:41.128 --> 07:43.607
for putting three thousand taels
in my bundle.

07:44.568 --> 07:45.528
Now,

07:45.528 --> 07:47.047
I want to use those silver notes

07:47.167 --> 07:48.047
as my betrothal gift.

07:48.528 --> 07:49.528
Betrothal gift?

07:54.927 --> 07:55.648
Mr. Zhao,

07:55.768 --> 07:56.847
will you marry me?

07:59.008 --> 08:00.328
I don't want to part from you.

08:01.968 --> 08:03.847
I like the name Xie Tingyun.

08:04.367 --> 08:05.768
I like you and Sen,

08:06.167 --> 08:07.328
and Biao and Chuan too.

08:07.328 --> 08:08.448
They are all good people.

08:08.568 --> 08:09.888
I've packed my things.

08:09.888 --> 08:11.367
I want to join the army with all of you.

08:13.528 --> 08:14.328
You like me

08:14.568 --> 08:15.448
and Sen?

08:16.247 --> 08:17.607
What does Sen have to do with it?

08:38.288 --> 08:39.487
I want to walk this road

08:39.847 --> 08:41.048
with all of you.

08:41.928 --> 08:43.208
Together we'll do business,

08:43.607 --> 08:44.727
together we'll earn our fame.

08:46.048 --> 08:47.527
Start from nothing,

08:48.127 --> 08:49.168
and build a legacy.

08:49.647 --> 08:50.487
We'll earn

08:50.487 --> 08:52.288
a real place in this world.

08:53.928 --> 08:54.968
I'll marry you.

09:00.527 --> 09:02.048
So you're investing in the venture?

09:04.408 --> 09:06.887
Did the Sixteenth Master send you
to persuade me

09:06.887 --> 09:07.607
to join the army?

09:15.127 --> 09:15.928
Mr. Zhao,

09:16.288 --> 09:18.887
joining the army
may be your only chance

09:18.887 --> 09:20.367
to improve your standing.

09:20.767 --> 09:22.568
You were cast out
of your family at eight.

09:22.688 --> 09:24.968
You've struggled through hardship
all these years.

09:25.088 --> 09:26.127
But in the end,

09:26.288 --> 09:28.607
you remain a lowly merchant.

09:29.088 --> 09:30.727
Times are good for you now,

09:31.448 --> 09:32.887
but what happens
when the Sixteenth Master leaves?

09:33.088 --> 09:34.288
What about years from now?

09:35.568 --> 09:37.088
Without changing your status,

09:37.168 --> 09:38.247
you will forever be

09:38.367 --> 09:40.288
fish on the chopping block,

09:41.048 --> 09:42.568
at the mercy of others.

09:46.688 --> 09:47.568
For you,

09:49.408 --> 09:50.408
marriage

09:53.808 --> 09:55.367
is nothing but a bond of interests

09:55.367 --> 09:56.487
and a path to advance your standing?

10:02.088 --> 10:03.328
The sugar is sweet,

10:04.208 --> 10:05.247
while coptis root is bitter.

10:06.408 --> 10:08.088
Boiled together,
they make a sweet healing draught.

10:11.048 --> 10:12.367
Perhaps in this world,

10:12.367 --> 10:13.607
the strongest alliances are forged

10:14.007 --> 10:16.288
when sincere hearts
yield mutual benefit,

10:16.767 --> 10:17.887
and that benefit

10:18.127 --> 10:19.408
ripens into genuine affection.

10:19.968 --> 10:21.727
The two can barely be told apart.

10:22.568 --> 10:24.088
Just like you and me.

10:25.928 --> 10:27.328
Bound by shared interests,

10:27.527 --> 10:29.448
we may rely on each other fully.

10:35.647 --> 10:37.288
I know my proposal is abrupt.

10:37.808 --> 10:38.568
It may offend you.

10:39.487 --> 10:40.247
So

10:42.007 --> 10:43.288
I'll only ask this once.

10:58.808 --> 10:59.887
No need to answer right away.

11:01.168 --> 11:02.288
Please think it over.

11:14.598 --> 11:15.738
(Yu Residence)

11:15.767 --> 11:18.208
Even if it's not the grand affair
we were promised,

11:18.448 --> 11:20.448
it should at least match
a family of this stature.

11:21.928 --> 11:23.127
But now,

11:23.928 --> 11:26.288
the procession is shabby,
and barely any guests.

11:26.568 --> 11:28.568
(Guest List)
Madam is giving you the cold shoulder.

11:34.208 --> 11:35.408
You should call me Madam Fan now.

11:35.808 --> 11:36.527
Understood.

11:37.928 --> 11:39.647
I've married into the Yu family
after all.

11:41.847 --> 11:43.367
That's what I wanted.

11:45.527 --> 11:47.328
As long as my husband cares for me,

11:48.688 --> 11:50.328
he will stand up for me.

11:50.847 --> 11:51.928
I refuse to believe

11:53.448 --> 11:55.127
that I'm not on an upward path.

11:55.928 --> 11:57.288
The days ahead are still long.

12:01.767 --> 12:03.847
It's not that I'm harsh on Fan.

12:04.688 --> 12:06.367
I'm just afraid you've been blinded

12:06.367 --> 12:07.647
by temporary affection.

12:09.127 --> 12:10.928
She is indeed talented.

12:11.328 --> 12:12.847
But her actions

12:13.607 --> 12:15.127
nearly brought the Yu family

12:15.127 --> 12:16.887
to the brink of ruin.

12:18.487 --> 12:21.247
Fu Tingyun used the flower cakes
to blackmail me

12:21.487 --> 12:23.727
for Fan's written confession.

12:24.048 --> 12:25.767
With that confession in hand,

12:26.088 --> 12:27.328
Fan's fate

12:27.448 --> 12:29.127
will forever be in her grip.

12:29.487 --> 12:31.448
If we ever clash in the future,

12:31.968 --> 12:33.408
we'll already be at a disadvantage.

12:34.487 --> 12:35.688
The Huaying affair

12:37.048 --> 12:38.487
was Zuo Junjie's doing.

12:39.247 --> 12:40.808
Fan gave false testimony,

12:41.448 --> 12:42.208
but she wasn't

12:42.727 --> 12:43.767
the ringleader.

12:54.607 --> 12:56.487
I'm glad to see
you're loyal and honorable.

12:57.288 --> 12:58.448
Since you're set on this,

13:00.928 --> 13:02.767
I wish you and your wife harmony.

13:07.168 --> 13:08.367
If I say any more,

13:09.168 --> 13:10.647
it would seem like I'm sowing discord.

13:16.448 --> 13:17.007
Mother.

13:20.527 --> 13:22.367
(Commentaries on the Four Books)
The annotated edition by Master Fan

13:23.487 --> 13:26.048
is a classic text that deserves
to be passed down through the ages.

13:27.208 --> 13:28.767
It should have been treasured.

13:29.367 --> 13:30.448
Yet Fan

13:31.088 --> 13:32.247
treated it

13:32.247 --> 13:33.968
like something
to be pawned or traded away.

13:35.088 --> 13:37.487
I've already bought back
all those texts.

13:43.647 --> 13:45.688
Return them to her.

13:45.928 --> 13:48.247
I hope she'll be grateful to you.

13:48.647 --> 13:49.968
What I can do

13:50.527 --> 13:51.887
ends here.

13:53.928 --> 13:55.607
She actually sold the classics?

13:57.367 --> 13:58.208
For what?

13:59.328 --> 14:00.127
Money?

14:06.448 --> 14:07.968
The marriage is settled.

14:08.928 --> 14:09.847
As for other things,

14:10.527 --> 14:12.288
don't dwell on them.

14:12.847 --> 14:14.288
For the family matter,

14:14.847 --> 14:17.208
I was fortunate to have some standing
with the Crown Prince,

14:17.448 --> 14:19.127
and I've managed to smooth things over.

14:19.367 --> 14:20.247
Jingxiu,

14:21.007 --> 14:22.127
from now on,

14:22.527 --> 14:24.568
you must not act so willfully again.

14:26.208 --> 14:27.208
I understand, Mother.

14:28.408 --> 14:29.168
Leave now.

14:37.487 --> 14:38.208
Madam.

14:38.727 --> 14:40.367
Send a letter to Madam Zuo.

14:41.328 --> 14:42.247
Tell her

14:42.328 --> 14:44.088
that an old acquaintance
is coming to find her.

14:44.527 --> 14:46.168
A widow being bullied by others

14:46.247 --> 14:47.487
is truly pitiful.

14:47.887 --> 14:49.527
If she needs our help,

14:49.527 --> 14:50.487
she can let us know.

14:50.568 --> 14:51.208
Understood.

14:52.007 --> 14:53.288
I'll go right away.

15:17.527 --> 15:19.968
(I thought she was as elegant
and pure as a narcissus.)

15:20.808 --> 15:22.968
(Unlike other women consumed
by worldly things.)

15:25.007 --> 15:27.247
(But she casually sells off
treasured texts,)

15:27.847 --> 15:29.288
(with no regard for their value.)

15:30.928 --> 15:32.168
(The name Yake,)
[*Meaning a cultured person.]

15:33.647 --> 15:35.088
(does she truly deserve it?)

15:37.448 --> 15:38.367
Jingxiu.

15:45.487 --> 15:46.607
It's getting late.

15:47.727 --> 15:48.527
Let's retire for the night.

16:16.247 --> 16:17.527
What did Miss Xie ask you?

16:20.168 --> 16:21.088
She said

16:21.088 --> 16:22.208
she wanted to marry me.

16:24.328 --> 16:25.688
She said she wanted me to marry her.

16:26.288 --> 16:27.288
And did you agree?

16:27.607 --> 16:28.607
She already gave the betrothal gift.

16:29.288 --> 16:30.048
Three thousand taels.

16:30.688 --> 16:32.127
Actual silver,
handed over just like that?

16:35.007 --> 16:36.847
This is a lifelong commitment.

16:36.968 --> 16:38.007
You'd better think it through.

16:42.168 --> 16:44.208
But she doesn't really want to marry me.

16:46.168 --> 16:47.767
She just wants to do business with me.

16:47.887 --> 16:49.727
For a couple to live together,

16:50.208 --> 16:51.288
the most important thing

16:51.448 --> 16:52.767
is sincerity.

17:00.367 --> 17:02.007
Whether it's sincerity or business,

17:02.647 --> 17:04.408
we must first secure a future
for the brothers.

17:11.688 --> 17:13.487
I even dared to be a salt bandit.

17:14.968 --> 17:15.928
What's there to fear

17:16.767 --> 17:17.767
in getting married?

17:19.327 --> 17:20.007
Pack your things.

17:21.168 --> 17:22.968
We're going to join the army.

17:23.408 --> 17:24.208
Join the army?

17:24.448 --> 17:25.247
Great!

17:25.608 --> 17:26.928
Then I can learn martial arts!

17:26.928 --> 17:27.767
Great!

17:28.247 --> 17:28.888
Wait.

17:29.448 --> 17:30.767
Why join the army all of a sudden?

17:32.567 --> 17:33.368
Am I going too?

17:39.168 --> 17:40.208
Have you settled on a place?

17:42.047 --> 17:42.767
Ganlin Town.

17:45.688 --> 17:47.448
I also serve in Ganlin Town.

17:47.648 --> 17:48.408
Buddy,

17:48.727 --> 17:50.527
you didn't choose it
just because you miss me,

17:50.527 --> 17:51.368
did you?

17:55.767 --> 17:56.727
Miss Xie,

17:57.087 --> 17:57.727
are you going too?

17:58.688 --> 18:00.287
Since we've got
a new household register,

18:00.727 --> 18:02.287
I'll go too.

18:02.608 --> 18:03.128
Alright.

18:03.727 --> 18:05.208
Since you refused my wedding gift,

18:05.368 --> 18:07.968
I will grant you one hundred mu of land

18:07.968 --> 18:09.807
as a wedding gift.

18:11.567 --> 18:12.807
Thank you, Your Highness.

18:15.287 --> 18:16.688
Miss Xie, you have a sharp mind.

18:17.168 --> 18:19.368
Miss Xie, you are quite astute.

18:19.648 --> 18:20.727
The road ahead is long.

18:20.807 --> 18:21.928
Be cautious at every step.

18:22.648 --> 18:23.848
I will always bear

18:24.287 --> 18:26.007
your teachings in mind.

18:27.208 --> 18:28.527
When you reach Ganlin Town,

18:28.727 --> 18:29.888
make sure to work hard.

18:30.727 --> 18:32.047
When you are promoted
to battalion commander,

18:32.047 --> 18:32.688
later,

18:32.767 --> 18:34.007
you will be very useful to me.

18:35.807 --> 18:37.168
I will not disappoint Your Highness.

18:37.946 --> 18:41.183
(Xie Residence)

19:04.128 --> 19:05.247
It's time to send a letter

19:06.047 --> 19:07.087
to Mother.

19:08.487 --> 19:09.287
(Dear Mother,)

19:09.767 --> 19:10.928
(when you read this,)

19:12.087 --> 19:13.767
(I have taken the surname Xie.)

19:14.287 --> 19:16.047
(And I am engaged to Zhao Ling.)

19:17.648 --> 19:19.128
(After all the upheavals,)

19:19.487 --> 19:20.968
(I have come to see
that a woman's marriage)

19:21.087 --> 19:23.128
(should not be based
only on status or wealth.)

19:23.648 --> 19:25.888
(Character and integrity matter more.)

19:27.287 --> 19:29.047
(Zhao Ling may come
from a humble background,)

19:29.247 --> 19:30.567
(but he is loyal, honorable,)

19:30.648 --> 19:31.767
(brave and resourceful.)

19:32.848 --> 19:33.648
(Now,)

19:33.648 --> 19:34.928
(he has found an opportunity.)

19:35.247 --> 19:36.888
(He will join the army in Ganlin Town.)

19:37.128 --> 19:38.247
(He has great potential.)

19:39.688 --> 19:41.648
(I am willing to stand by his side.)

19:42.368 --> 19:43.567
(We will start from nothing.)

19:44.168 --> 19:45.688
(I believe that with his sense of duty,)

19:45.688 --> 19:47.247
(and with my planning,)

19:47.727 --> 19:49.448
(we will surely carve out a future.)

19:50.767 --> 19:52.567
(I cannot be by your side
to care for you,)

19:53.168 --> 19:54.968
(so please take good care of yourself.)

19:56.168 --> 19:56.888
(Your daughter,)

19:57.688 --> 19:58.487
(Tingyun.)

20:13.527 --> 20:14.287
Biao

20:14.648 --> 20:15.567
and Chuan.

20:15.807 --> 20:16.888
You're back.

20:17.487 --> 20:18.368
You scared me just now.

20:18.368 --> 20:18.888
What are you doing?

20:19.087 --> 20:19.807
Don't come near.

20:22.448 --> 20:23.527
Time to tickle you.

20:23.527 --> 20:24.007
No tickling!

20:24.007 --> 20:25.047
You're getting cheeky again.

20:26.487 --> 20:27.247
I was wrong.

20:29.661 --> 20:30.341
Don't tickle me.

20:35.648 --> 20:36.567
Strong liquor burns the throat.

20:36.848 --> 20:37.688
Let's have fruit syrup instead.

20:40.128 --> 20:40.567
Here.

20:41.767 --> 20:44.007
In this world, kinship

20:46.168 --> 20:47.608
need not come from birth.

20:48.208 --> 20:49.448
When hearts are one,

20:49.928 --> 20:51.487
even strangers

20:51.807 --> 20:53.168
can walk the same path.

20:59.247 --> 21:01.128
No matter how hard the road ahead,

21:02.648 --> 21:04.767
I want to build a family with you.

21:05.087 --> 21:06.807
A family of our own.

21:14.408 --> 21:15.688
Gather the good.

21:16.208 --> 21:18.007
Trust one another with our lives.

21:38.047 --> 21:38.608
Alright.

21:40.327 --> 21:40.968
I will never let

21:43.928 --> 21:45.608
your kindness go unanswered.

22:16.608 --> 22:18.087
People say that wealth

22:18.287 --> 22:19.848
blinds the eyes.

22:20.888 --> 22:22.527
But these worldly riches

22:22.888 --> 22:24.928
truly do not interest me.

22:25.968 --> 22:27.928
All my planning and scheming

22:28.648 --> 22:31.168
is only to do what others cannot do,

22:31.727 --> 22:33.608
and to bring down those others cannot.

22:38.208 --> 22:39.527
Lord Yan has been arrested,

22:39.888 --> 22:41.287
and Grand Secretary Liu is implicated.

22:41.928 --> 22:43.208
In court rivalries,

22:43.928 --> 22:45.727
if those above do not fall,

22:46.408 --> 22:48.727
how can those below rise?

22:51.527 --> 22:52.968
With the Liu family's fall,

22:52.968 --> 22:54.727
a seat opens in the Grand Secretariat.

22:55.408 --> 22:56.807
If Master enters the Grand Secretariat,

22:56.888 --> 22:58.327
we will hear by year's end.

22:58.567 --> 23:00.567
You have accomplished such a great deed,

23:01.007 --> 23:02.928
and Master will surely be grateful.

23:06.047 --> 23:07.648
We also owe thanks to Fan

23:08.168 --> 23:10.688
for making that mistake
before the Crown Prince.

23:11.208 --> 23:12.648
After this,

23:13.247 --> 23:16.128
who will still be on guard
against our family?

23:18.567 --> 23:20.168
Others will only think

23:20.168 --> 23:22.007
that the Yu family was too eager

23:22.208 --> 23:24.287
to curry favor with His Highness.

23:24.688 --> 23:25.648
But they do not know

23:25.727 --> 23:27.208
that true success

23:28.408 --> 23:30.408
need not be seen by others.

23:30.968 --> 23:31.928
Indeed.

23:32.208 --> 23:33.928
Did not Madam Yan fail

23:33.928 --> 23:35.368
because she was too conspicuous?

23:36.007 --> 23:37.128
And also because

23:37.848 --> 23:39.688
she and her husband
were not of one mind.

23:43.688 --> 23:44.368
Do I look good?

23:44.648 --> 23:45.287
Good.

23:47.287 --> 23:47.928
Miss Xie,

23:48.047 --> 23:49.047
this is my husband.

23:49.128 --> 23:49.848
Zheng San.

23:50.527 --> 23:52.087
We were separated in the famine,

23:52.087 --> 23:52.968
and have just reunited.

23:54.287 --> 23:55.408
Thank you for taking us in.

23:56.007 --> 23:57.087
My wife and I

23:57.208 --> 23:58.368
will serve you faithfully.

23:58.608 --> 24:00.448
We will not betray your trust.

24:01.087 --> 24:02.567
We've shared life and death together.

24:02.807 --> 24:04.928
From now on, we'll stand by each other.

24:06.888 --> 24:08.567
Chuan's not hungry. Don't give him any.

24:08.727 --> 24:09.727
You rascal.

24:11.727 --> 24:12.527
Smells good, right?

24:13.007 --> 24:14.087
- Careful, don't burn yourself.
- Here.

24:14.327 --> 24:14.848
It's fine.

24:15.327 --> 24:16.128
Smells really good.

24:16.688 --> 24:17.767
Careful, don't burn yourself.

24:18.247 --> 24:18.807
Smells really good.

24:18.807 --> 24:19.287
Mr. Zhao!

24:22.888 --> 24:24.128
Pry out the root.

24:25.928 --> 24:27.128
Mother, take it slow.

24:27.767 --> 24:29.527
I told you not to come out.

24:30.128 --> 24:31.327
Mother, slow down.

24:31.968 --> 24:32.888
Mr. Zhao.

24:33.128 --> 24:33.807
Be careful.

24:33.807 --> 24:34.567
Mr. Zhao.

24:35.408 --> 24:36.888
Mr. Zhao, please take this.

24:37.128 --> 24:38.208
Wish you luck and safety.

24:38.983 --> 24:39.623
Thank you.

24:42.087 --> 24:42.727
Hold firmly.

24:43.567 --> 24:43.968
Here.

24:43.968 --> 24:44.567
Thank you.

24:46.848 --> 24:47.767
Ganlin is far away.

24:48.130 --> 24:48.670
Hold firmly.

24:48.688 --> 24:49.448
Safe travels.

24:53.128 --> 24:53.888
Yucheng.

24:55.168 --> 24:56.047
Will you come with me

24:56.368 --> 24:57.608
to seek a post in Ganlin?

25:00.368 --> 25:01.327
My mother is old.

25:01.688 --> 25:02.287
I...

25:02.368 --> 25:03.727
Come with us, Yucheng.

25:03.727 --> 25:04.448
Come on.

25:04.448 --> 25:05.128
Come on.

25:05.128 --> 25:05.527
Right.

25:05.527 --> 25:06.767
Go for it.

25:06.767 --> 25:07.888
Following Mr. Zhao

25:07.888 --> 25:10.648
is better than being a bandit
or smuggling salt.

25:11.928 --> 25:13.128
If you're willing,

25:13.567 --> 25:14.807
once we're settled,

25:15.408 --> 25:16.527
we can bring your mother

25:16.527 --> 25:17.168
to join us.

25:18.928 --> 25:20.688
Yucheng, you have real skill.

25:20.848 --> 25:22.368
You'll have a place in the army.

25:23.608 --> 25:24.767
Your mother will be at peace too.

25:35.247 --> 25:36.087
I, Yang Yucheng,

25:36.608 --> 25:37.608
shall obey your wishes.

25:38.007 --> 25:40.208
I will follow Mr. Zhao to Ganlin.

25:41.287 --> 25:42.247
I will not go back on my word.

25:42.888 --> 25:43.408
Rise.

25:43.408 --> 25:46.527
Good!

25:46.527 --> 25:47.848
This is good.

25:48.928 --> 25:50.007
When I'm free...

25:50.007 --> 25:50.527
Mr. Zhao.

25:50.767 --> 25:51.928
The flowers Miss Xie likes,

25:51.928 --> 25:52.968
I've dug them up.

25:58.408 --> 25:59.128
What about you?

26:02.888 --> 26:04.087
You'll stay in Yongning Prefecture.

26:05.848 --> 26:07.007
I've secured a salt permit for you

26:07.007 --> 26:08.087
from the Sixteenth Master.

26:09.368 --> 26:10.287
What you make of it

26:11.087 --> 26:12.168
is up to you.

26:13.673 --> 26:14.580
(Salt Permit)

26:14.608 --> 26:15.368
Mr. Zhao.

26:15.567 --> 26:17.527
Money and supplies are no problem.

26:17.527 --> 26:19.408
But the salt permit
is the hardest to get.

26:19.608 --> 26:20.327
Mr. Zhao,

26:20.727 --> 26:21.767
when you leave for Ganlin,

26:21.767 --> 26:22.968
leave the salt business to me.

26:22.968 --> 26:24.287
We'll remain

26:24.287 --> 26:25.487
as we were.

26:26.287 --> 26:27.848
No matter how big the business grows,

26:28.807 --> 26:29.928
it all comes from you, Mr. Zhao.

26:31.899 --> 26:34.500
(Outskirts)

26:38.168 --> 26:39.208
Ninth Young Lady.

26:39.448 --> 26:40.648
On your way to Ganlin,

26:40.888 --> 26:42.007
take care of yourself.

26:42.487 --> 26:43.727
Thank you for your concern, Madam.

26:53.047 --> 26:54.247
From now on,

26:54.527 --> 26:56.327
I will start from nothing with Mr. Zhao.

26:57.527 --> 26:59.047
It will be a fresh start.

27:00.487 --> 27:03.047
These two have talent,

27:03.247 --> 27:04.888
and they have strategy,

27:05.247 --> 27:06.928
and they have luck.

27:07.888 --> 27:08.968
But in the end,

27:09.888 --> 27:11.567
they are still inexperienced.

27:12.208 --> 27:13.807
They truly believe

27:14.087 --> 27:16.527
that starting from nothing is easy.

27:16.928 --> 27:19.487
Little do they know that climbing up
from the bottom

27:19.487 --> 27:21.208
is not about the obvious enemies

27:21.208 --> 27:22.727
who sit high above.

27:23.608 --> 27:25.408
It's the small potato.

27:25.608 --> 27:27.047
One wrong move,

27:27.968 --> 27:31.368
and you'll be rolling in the mud
with lowlifes.

27:32.608 --> 27:34.807
Look at the things they're carrying.

27:35.087 --> 27:36.327
Too exquisite.

27:37.047 --> 27:39.408
Isn't this exactly the mistake
that Madam Yan made?

27:39.408 --> 27:44.360
(Yongning Prefecture)

27:53.410 --> 27:55.190
(Admonitions for Women Hall)

28:08.128 --> 28:10.608
The rule here has always been
for skirts to cover the feet.

28:10.848 --> 28:12.608
Yet you dared to cut yours short
by three cun.

28:14.368 --> 28:15.807
It's the harvest season,

28:16.087 --> 28:17.648
and my elder brother is gravely ill.

28:17.888 --> 28:20.408
I thought that with a shorter skirt,

28:20.807 --> 28:22.487
I could work in the fields more easily.

28:35.968 --> 28:36.888
First,

28:36.968 --> 28:38.368
your brother is ill,

28:38.487 --> 28:40.087
and his wife can tend to him.

28:40.567 --> 28:41.807
You have no part in that.

28:41.888 --> 28:42.848
Second,

28:42.968 --> 28:44.888
you are an unmarried young woman.

28:44.888 --> 28:46.807
Yet you show yourself in public
to do farm work.

28:47.128 --> 28:47.888
You are shaming

28:48.128 --> 28:50.007
your future husband's reputation.

28:50.247 --> 28:51.128
Third,

28:51.128 --> 28:53.448
do you not know that these three cun
of exposed skin

28:54.287 --> 28:56.448
could ruin the reputation
of many families?

29:01.608 --> 29:02.448
Ms. Zuo,

29:02.567 --> 29:04.047
a letter has arrived
from Yongning Prefecture.

29:24.648 --> 29:25.448
We're here.

29:25.527 --> 29:26.608
(Ganlin Town)
We're here.

29:26.807 --> 29:28.287
We've arrived in Ganlin Town.

29:49.710 --> 29:50.310
(Ganlin Town)

29:50.327 --> 29:51.767
I need to register at the yamen first.

29:52.047 --> 29:53.327
You all follow General Mo
to get settled.

29:59.888 --> 30:00.848
General!

30:01.807 --> 30:02.888
General!

30:10.327 --> 30:11.047
General.

30:11.287 --> 30:12.368
What are you doing here?

30:12.727 --> 30:14.047
I asked everyone I met

30:14.247 --> 30:15.727
when you would return.

30:16.208 --> 30:18.168
But no one would tell me.

30:18.767 --> 30:20.767
I wanted to ask Madam,

30:21.007 --> 30:22.567
but I was afraid of getting scolded.

30:22.767 --> 30:24.848
So I just waited here.

30:25.007 --> 30:26.327
After several days,

30:26.848 --> 30:29.087
I finally waited for your return.

30:29.487 --> 30:30.807
You poor thing.

30:30.888 --> 30:31.648
Where is Madam?

30:32.767 --> 30:34.247
The wife of Commander Wang

30:34.247 --> 30:36.007
is here to welcome
the new soldiers' families.

30:36.287 --> 30:37.408
Right now, Madam

30:37.408 --> 30:39.727
is inside with Madam Wang.

30:43.287 --> 30:43.968
Oh no.

30:46.487 --> 30:46.968
Here.

30:47.968 --> 30:48.648
General.

30:48.767 --> 30:49.487
Sanniang.

30:49.567 --> 30:51.128
I want to talk to Miss Xie.

30:51.247 --> 30:51.888
Miss Xie.

30:53.767 --> 30:54.567
General Mo.

30:54.567 --> 30:55.327
Miss Xie.

30:55.327 --> 30:56.368
Let me introduce you.

30:56.727 --> 30:57.648
She is

30:57.928 --> 30:58.527
my...

30:59.208 --> 30:59.848
my...

31:01.287 --> 31:01.888
the woman at home.

31:03.527 --> 31:04.608
Greetings, Madam Mo.

31:05.208 --> 31:06.128
No.

31:07.047 --> 31:07.767
Miss Xie,

31:08.287 --> 31:09.608
you don't need to call her Madam.

31:09.608 --> 31:10.767
Just call her Lu.

31:11.327 --> 31:12.408
This is Miss Xie.

31:12.807 --> 31:13.448
(Concubine Lu, General Mo's concubine)
Miss Xie.

31:13.567 --> 31:14.608
May I ask a favor?

31:14.767 --> 31:15.448
Could you take her

31:15.688 --> 31:17.047
with you in your carriage?

31:17.128 --> 31:18.527
Please don't let her get off.

31:18.848 --> 31:19.487
Sorry to trouble you.

31:19.928 --> 31:20.527
Get in the carriage.

31:20.608 --> 31:21.208
General.

31:21.287 --> 31:21.928
Get in.

31:21.928 --> 31:22.527
General.

31:22.527 --> 31:23.047
Be good.

31:23.047 --> 31:23.648
Get in now.

31:23.727 --> 31:24.807
Sorry to trouble you, Miss Xie.

31:37.648 --> 31:38.527
You were

31:40.007 --> 31:41.807
brought here by the general too?

31:44.287 --> 31:45.408
Then from now on,

31:46.047 --> 31:47.247
treat me with due respect.

32:22.247 --> 32:23.567
He sure

32:25.408 --> 32:27.247
spends a lot on you.

32:30.527 --> 32:33.128
I heard supplies are tight
in Ganlin Town.

32:33.368 --> 32:35.408
General Mo told us to stock up.

32:35.848 --> 32:37.807
So I bought a little bit of everything.

32:37.807 --> 32:39.567
He also lets you hold all the money?

32:42.448 --> 32:44.287
He says he's not good
at managing things.

32:45.168 --> 32:47.287
He asked me to help him handle it.

32:48.128 --> 32:49.448
That ungrateful man.

32:54.408 --> 32:55.807
Let me be clear

32:55.888 --> 32:57.208
right from the start.

32:57.448 --> 32:58.968
In a household like ours,

32:59.327 --> 33:01.007
rules matter most.

33:02.007 --> 33:03.168
The two of you

33:03.487 --> 33:04.888
haven't gone through proper formalities.

33:06.567 --> 33:07.648
As the newcomer,

33:08.287 --> 33:09.247
you must defer to me

33:09.247 --> 33:10.487
in all things.

33:10.648 --> 33:11.888
Do not overstep.

33:14.087 --> 33:15.087
Do you understand?

33:16.247 --> 33:17.327
Well,

33:19.087 --> 33:20.848
I really don't quite understand.

33:21.928 --> 33:22.648
Miss Xie.

33:22.848 --> 33:24.287
Several military wives have come.

33:24.408 --> 33:25.848
They say they've come to welcome you.

33:26.087 --> 33:28.408
There's Madam Wang
from the Commander's residence,

33:28.487 --> 33:29.688
and Madam Mo.

33:35.087 --> 33:36.448
I wonder who she is.

33:36.767 --> 33:37.848
That girl is really lovely.

33:37.848 --> 33:38.527
Here she comes.

33:39.087 --> 33:40.208
She's so pretty.

33:43.287 --> 33:44.648
Greetings, ladies.

33:46.408 --> 33:47.727
Look.

33:47.888 --> 33:48.928
(Madam Mo, General Mo's wife)
You are truly

33:48.928 --> 33:50.648
(Madam Wang, Commander Wang's wife)
like someone out of a painting.

33:51.007 --> 33:53.168
We've been traveling
and are quite worn out.

33:53.368 --> 33:54.688
I hope we haven't disturbed you.

33:54.848 --> 33:55.928
Don't be so formal.

33:56.168 --> 33:57.247
From now on,

33:57.567 --> 33:58.968
we're all family.

33:58.968 --> 33:59.527
Come.

34:00.408 --> 34:01.567
This is Madam Wang.

34:02.168 --> 34:02.928
And

34:02.928 --> 34:04.807
this is Xie from Yongning Prefecture.

34:12.848 --> 34:13.968
So beautiful.

34:25.687 --> 34:27.047
Xie, you are truly lovely.

34:27.167 --> 34:28.368
We've only just arrived.

34:28.487 --> 34:29.647
There are just small tokens
of our appreciation.

34:29.647 --> 34:32.607
Madam Wang and Madam Mo,
I hope you will not mind.

34:33.368 --> 34:34.288
Not at all.

34:34.288 --> 34:34.687
Come.

34:34.808 --> 34:35.687
How exquisite.

34:35.687 --> 34:36.288
You go first.

34:36.288 --> 34:37.687
So pretty.

34:37.687 --> 34:38.728
I'll take this one.

34:38.728 --> 34:39.207
Lovely.

34:39.207 --> 34:40.127
Pink.

34:40.647 --> 34:41.047
Pretty.

34:41.047 --> 34:41.687
Very pretty.

34:41.687 --> 34:42.368
Isn't it?

34:42.728 --> 34:43.728
Pink looks lovely.

34:44.928 --> 34:46.207
She's new,

34:46.448 --> 34:48.007
yet she shows off.

34:48.448 --> 34:49.768
Why can't I?

34:56.808 --> 34:57.928
So beautiful.

35:00.647 --> 35:01.368
Is it pretty?

35:01.368 --> 35:02.288
Pretty.

35:02.448 --> 35:04.127
Madam Mo, it's beautiful.

35:04.567 --> 35:05.408
From now on,

35:05.647 --> 35:07.448
no more "Madam".

35:07.448 --> 35:08.487
Let's treat each other

35:08.607 --> 35:10.087
like sisters.

35:10.607 --> 35:11.848
So pretty.

35:13.487 --> 35:15.007
We military wives are simple folks.

35:15.007 --> 35:16.207
We rarely have a chance to dress up.

35:16.328 --> 35:18.047
In the whole garrison,
there's just one person

35:18.047 --> 35:19.328
who's always so flashy.

35:19.328 --> 35:21.087
She even picks wildflowers
just to dress up.

35:27.567 --> 35:28.808
Where are my flowers?

35:29.647 --> 35:30.647
Where are my flowers?

35:30.647 --> 35:31.408
Miss Xie,

35:31.408 --> 35:32.288
come take a look.

35:32.448 --> 35:34.007
Could your luggage have been robbed?

35:34.007 --> 35:35.207
Where did you steal those velvet flowers

35:35.207 --> 35:36.288
and stick them all over your head?

35:36.288 --> 35:37.408
You tactless fool.

35:37.408 --> 35:39.288
She's a distinguished guest here
with her fiance to join the army.

35:39.288 --> 35:40.687
She's truly from a military household.

35:40.768 --> 35:42.087
If you damage her things,

35:42.087 --> 35:42.808
you'll have to pay.

35:42.808 --> 35:43.687
Exactly.

35:48.127 --> 35:49.487
You have misunderstood.

35:49.687 --> 35:52.567
I lent her these velvet flowers
just to try on.

35:52.728 --> 35:53.768
Exactly.

35:54.328 --> 35:56.167
Miss Xie is generous.

35:56.487 --> 35:57.888
Unlike some people

35:58.047 --> 35:59.487
who are petty.

35:59.487 --> 36:01.047
- You!
- Who are you talking about?

36:01.047 --> 36:01.968
Say that again!

36:03.808 --> 36:05.487
Should've said they were her castoffs.

36:06.848 --> 36:08.167
Why give them to me then?

36:11.087 --> 36:12.087
If she's worn

36:13.288 --> 36:14.368
this velvet flower,

36:15.127 --> 36:16.127
I don't want it.

36:16.808 --> 36:17.248
Let's go.

36:20.640 --> 36:23.553
(Gandu Circuit Military Camp)

36:24.968 --> 36:25.448
Look.

36:25.448 --> 36:26.848
Where did that fool come from?

36:27.207 --> 36:28.487
He's been waiting there for four hours.

36:48.808 --> 36:50.408
Commander.

36:54.768 --> 36:56.368
They say a hundred years ago,

36:56.487 --> 36:58.687
General Zhou fought the Wangur people.

36:58.928 --> 37:01.487
With a Humu-wood tiger-sinew bow,

37:01.968 --> 37:03.288
(Lord Wang, Gandu Circuit Commander)
he slew their leader.

37:03.607 --> 37:05.007
Today, that divine bow

37:05.007 --> 37:07.647
is right before your eyes.

37:07.968 --> 37:09.328
As the saying goes,

37:09.328 --> 37:10.647
a fine sword is gifted to a hero.

37:11.368 --> 37:12.127
I believe

37:12.408 --> 37:13.647
this divine bow

37:14.047 --> 37:15.728
is a perfect match for you, Lord Wang.

37:16.087 --> 37:16.888
I cannot accept it.

37:18.527 --> 37:21.448
(Li Mao, Gandu Circuit Military Advisor)
You have managed the military supplies

37:21.448 --> 37:23.448
and provisions all these years.

37:23.728 --> 37:25.288
Your service alone is a great favor.

37:25.448 --> 37:26.527
If you truly wish to show appreciation,

37:26.928 --> 37:29.607
when new recruits arrive in a few days,

37:29.968 --> 37:32.328
just allocate more provisions for them.

37:32.328 --> 37:34.687
Have I ever shortchanged

37:34.808 --> 37:36.968
the soldiers' provisions?

37:40.448 --> 37:41.288
Zhao,

37:41.487 --> 37:42.647
why are you standing out here?

37:52.368 --> 37:53.207
Lord Wang.

37:54.087 --> 37:55.007
Greetings, Lord Wang.

37:55.288 --> 37:56.527
You're finally back.

37:57.047 --> 37:58.808
You deserve top credit for this battle.

37:59.047 --> 37:59.768
You should be rewarded.

38:00.207 --> 38:01.768
I was rewarded before I returned.

38:01.768 --> 38:02.848
There's more?

38:04.248 --> 38:05.207
Yes.

38:06.288 --> 38:07.167
This bow

38:07.567 --> 38:08.808
should be given

38:09.328 --> 38:10.968
to the soldiers who proved themselves.

38:12.167 --> 38:13.848
What do you think, Advisor Li?

38:14.368 --> 38:16.888
Lord Wang, you treat your men
like family.

38:17.207 --> 38:18.408
I admire that deeply.

38:19.928 --> 38:20.527
Lord Wang,

38:20.888 --> 38:22.328
this is indeed a fine bow.

38:22.728 --> 38:24.087
But on my trip to Yongning Prefecture,

38:24.087 --> 38:25.408
I wasn't the top contributor.

38:26.007 --> 38:27.328
Let me introduce someone to you.

38:28.007 --> 38:28.567
Over there.

38:29.167 --> 38:30.127
His name is Zhao Ling.

38:30.127 --> 38:31.448
He's our new Banner Commander.

38:34.184 --> 38:36.157
(Visiting Card)

38:39.408 --> 38:40.207
You.

38:47.408 --> 38:48.687
I am the Banner Commander, Zhao Ling.

38:50.007 --> 38:50.928
Greetings, Lord Wang,

38:53.288 --> 38:54.328
Advisor Li.

38:57.567 --> 38:59.007
This visiting card of yours

39:00.768 --> 39:02.487
comes from quite a source.

39:04.607 --> 39:06.567
Ganlin Town is just a small place.

39:07.328 --> 39:09.607
Can you really settle for it?

39:10.888 --> 39:11.647
I will

39:13.007 --> 39:14.047
stand tall

39:14.848 --> 39:15.968
between heaven and earth.

39:17.408 --> 39:18.087
Lord Wang,

39:19.087 --> 39:20.087
the bow...

39:23.607 --> 39:24.408
Guards,

39:25.487 --> 39:26.567
take this bow

39:28.207 --> 39:29.167
and

39:31.567 --> 39:33.408
send it to General Mo's residence.

39:33.567 --> 39:33.968
Understood.

39:33.968 --> 39:34.687
Drink up.

39:34.687 --> 39:35.248
Come on.

39:35.248 --> 39:35.607
Cheers.

39:36.167 --> 39:36.607
Come.

39:37.567 --> 39:38.768
Advisor Li, join us.

39:38.768 --> 39:40.047
Zhao, come on.

39:41.087 --> 39:42.448
Fill them up.

39:42.647 --> 39:43.328
Bottoms up.

39:43.328 --> 39:43.687
Alright.

39:44.647 --> 39:45.607
Come on.

39:45.607 --> 39:46.408
Drink up.

39:46.928 --> 39:48.047
Three bowls in a row.

39:48.527 --> 39:48.968
Alright.

39:48.968 --> 39:49.487
Another round.

39:54.527 --> 39:55.007
Come.

39:55.127 --> 39:55.888
Fill it up.

39:55.968 --> 39:56.808
Come, pour me another.

39:58.527 --> 39:59.368
One more.

40:04.070 --> 40:06.690
(Next Episode)

40:06.888 --> 40:07.527
Miss Xie,

40:07.768 --> 40:09.607
the fields granted
by the Sixteenth Master were taken.

40:09.687 --> 40:10.527
And now you've seized

40:10.607 --> 40:12.368
Banner Commander Zhao's fields.

40:12.527 --> 40:13.687
How can I face anyone

40:13.687 --> 40:14.647
in the military now?

40:14.647 --> 40:15.567
His fields?

40:15.768 --> 40:16.728
I reclaimed the wasteland!

40:16.888 --> 40:18.768
If we can't even keep a field,

40:19.328 --> 40:20.288
how can we

40:20.728 --> 40:21.888
stand firm here?

40:22.288 --> 40:23.127
If you want to fight,

40:23.368 --> 40:24.047
then fight.

40:24.448 --> 40:25.928
You were absent without leave,

40:26.127 --> 40:27.448
abandoning your post.

40:27.687 --> 40:28.768
By military law,

40:28.968 --> 40:30.448
that's eighty strokes.

40:30.607 --> 40:32.687
You have no regard for military law.

40:32.888 --> 40:33.928
Without severe punishment,

40:34.567 --> 40:35.848
how can discipline be maintained?

40:36.167 --> 40:36.808
Strike!

40:50.720 --> 40:55.040
♪The past brushes by
like a falling leaf♪

40:58.640 --> 41:03.000
♪So light, yet my steps still pause
for you♪

41:05.120 --> 41:09.760
♪Through every rise and fall,
our memories remain without regret♪

41:10.000 --> 41:12.800
♪Carved into the rings of time♪

41:13.960 --> 41:18.600
♪How I wish I could stay
a little longer, but I can't♪

41:21.800 --> 41:28.640
♪I turn away, afraid goodbye will fill
my eyes with tears♪

41:29.520 --> 41:36.040
♪Etched deep within my heart,
yet buried without a word♪

41:37.000 --> 41:40.440
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

41:40.960 --> 41:45.160
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

41:45.440 --> 41:51.120
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪

42:03.240 --> 42:07.120
♪For one fleeting moment, I found you
in the crowd♪

42:11.040 --> 42:15.040
♪Without a word, you lit up
half my life♪

42:16.760 --> 42:21.440
♪In silence, a love too deep for words♪

42:21.760 --> 42:24.440
♪Kept close within my heart♪

42:25.520 --> 42:30.360
♪From now on, no one else
is worth waiting for♪

42:33.880 --> 42:40.800
♪I turn away, afraid no one
will ever come home to me again♪

42:41.680 --> 42:48.160
♪If we can build our future together,
no storm can chill my heart♪

42:49.040 --> 42:52.560
♪The warmth of your hand in mine♪

42:53.000 --> 42:57.360
♪Still makes us want to believe♪

42:57.560 --> 43:03.280
♪One promise for a lifetime,
echoing long after we part♪
